        "title": "Replace GPT 6 Luna with Muse Spark 1.3 in model picker presets",
        "summary": "The premium tier of the Freebuff model picker now recommends `FREEBUFF_MUSE_SPARK_13_CONTRIBUTOR_MODEL_ID` for the powerful slot instead of `FREEBUFF_GPT_6_LUNA_MODEL_ID`, aligning with the model catalog's migration of Muse Spark 1.3 into the picker. The underlying mechanism simplifies by removing off-peak pricing logic, `FREEBUFF_DEEPSEEK_V4_FLASH_FAST_MODEL_ID` toggling, and the `countryCode` parameter, so all premium accounts receive the same three stops regardless of geography. A new fallback in `preset` ensures that if the Muse Spark model is withdrawn from the catalog, the powerful slot degrades to `FREEBUFF_DEEPSEEK_V4_FLASH_MODEL_ID` at 'high' effort rather than failing.",
